    "notes": "Exact-QID mapped pyramid outline fixes the almost-cardinal anchor and heading. Separate OSM Sphinx body/head, entry canopy and roadside obelisk establish the eastward signed phase and individual locations; independent northern hotel parts retain their stepped footprints. Operator site map and constructor aerial corroborate the full layout. Ground Y0 and geographic flat-terrain load/unload passed. Visible 182.88 m glass base follows the measured map skin and the published diagonal inclinator angle; the contractor's 660 ft structural base describes a different extent and is not stretched onto the skin."
